OL,3,GNEWSAAutistic girl, age six, 'cries
OL,4,Aherself to sleep' during fireworks
OL,5,Aseason
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlthough she is only six, Grace Miller
OL,8,Falready knows what to do when fireworks
OL,9,Fseason arrives every year.
OL,11,FShe will head to her bedroom, pull the
OL,12,Fdoor closed and the blinds down, and
OL,13,Ftry to hide from the barrage of noise
OL,14,Fhappening outside.
OL,16,FHowever no matter how much effort Grace
OL,17,Fputs in, she is often left crying and
OL,18,Fdeeply distressed by the constant
OL,19,Fexplosions during October and November.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
