OL,3,GNEWSAAutistic girl, age six, 'cries
OL,4,Aherself to sleep' during fireworks
OL,5,Aseason
OL,6,
OL,7,FGrace, of Kirkintilloch, has autism and
OL,8,Fis among those - adults and children -
OL,9,Fwhose sensory issues are affected
OL,10,Fduring the period around Bonfire Night.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
